%header.max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-6.py-5.flex.items-center.justify-between
  .flex.items-center.gap-2
    = image_tag "logo.svg", alt: "", class: "w-8 h-8"
    %span.text-lg.font-bold.text-primary Tally
  = link_to "Log in", rodauth.login_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-text hover:text-primary"

%section.max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-6.pt-10.pb-16
  .grid.gap-12{class: "md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center"}
    %div
      %h1.text-4xl.font-bold.leading-tight.text-text{class: "md:text-5xl"}
        Calorie tracking
        %span.text-primary without the clutter
      %p.mt-5.text-lg.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
        Log what you eat in a few taps. Scan a barcode, pick a food, done.
        Your day on one screen — calories and macros against targets you set.
      .mt-8.flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-4
        = link_to "Create a free account", rodauth.create_account_path, class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold hover:bg-primary-light transition-colors"
        = link_to "I already have one", rodauth.login_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline"
      %p.mt-4.text-sm.text-text-secondary
        Works in any browser. iPhone and iPad app coming to the App Store.
    .flex.justify-center
      = image_tag "screenshot-today.png", alt: "Tally's day view, showing meals with calories and macros", class: "w-full max-w-xs rounded-3xl border border-border shadow-xl"

%section.bg-bg-page.border-y.border-border
  .max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-6.py-16
    %h2.text-2xl.font-bold.text-text.text-center Everything you need, nothing you don't
    .mt-12.grid.gap-10{class: "md:grid-cols-3"}
      %div
        %h3.text-base.font-bold.text-text Scan a barcode
        %p.mt-2.text-sm.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
          Point the camera at any supermarket product. Over a million foods from
          Open Food Facts and USDA FoodData Central, free and open.
      %div
        %h3.text-base.font-bold.text-text Your own foods
        %p.mt-2.text-sm.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
          Enter the things you actually eat once, and reuse them forever. Build
          recipes from ingredients and log them by the serving.
      %div
        %h3.text-base.font-bold.text-text Macros that add up
        %p.mt-2.text-sm.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
          Calories plus protein, carbs, fat and fibre, per meal and per day,
          against targets you choose yourself.

%section.max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-6.py-16
  .grid.gap-12{class: "md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center"}
    .flex.justify-center{class: "md:order-2"}
      = image_tag "screenshot-recipes.png", alt: "Recipes list showing calories per 100g and servings", class: "w-full max-w-xs rounded-3xl border border-border shadow-xl"
    %div{class: "md:order-1"}
      %h2.text-2xl.font-bold.text-text Cook once, log all week
      %p.mt-4.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
        Build a recipe from its ingredients and Tally works out the numbers per
        serving. Save the breakfast you eat every day as a template and log it
        with one tap.
      %ul.mt-6.space-y-2.text-sm.text-text-secondary
        %li • Four meals a day: breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks
        %li • Recent and frequent foods, one tap away
        %li • Edit a portion and every total recalculates

%section.bg-primary-tint.border-y.border-border
  .max-w-3xl.mx-auto.px-6.py-16.text-center
    %h2.text-2xl.font-bold.text-text Your data stays yours
    %p.mt-4.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
      Tally shows no adverts, runs no third-party analytics or tracking, and
      doesn't sell or share what you log. Delete your account from inside the
      app and everything you logged goes with it, immediately.
    .mt-8
      = link_to "Create a free account", rodauth.create_account_path, class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold hover:bg-primary-light transition-colors"

%footer.max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-6.py-10
  .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-between.gap-4
    %p.text-sm.text-text-secondary © 2026 Tally
    %nav.flex.flex-wrap.gap-5.text-sm
      = link_to "Privacy", privacy_path, class: "text-text-secondary hover:text-primary"
      = link_to "Terms", terms_path, class: "text-text-secondary hover:text-primary"
      = link_to "Support", support_path, class: "text-text-secondary hover:text-primary"
  %p.mt-6.text-xs.text-text-secondary.leading-relaxed
    Nutrition data from
    %a.underline{href: "https://world.openfoodfacts.org", rel: "noopener"} Open Food Facts
    (ODbL) and
    %a.underline{href: "https://fdc.nal.usda.gov", rel: "noopener"} USDA FoodData Central
    \. Figures are estimates, not laboratory measurements. Tally is not medical
    advice.
